    "notes": "Exact-QID stepped shaft and independent three-level west wing preserve their signed map frame. Primary architect description confirms 45-degree street rotation and western gallery; three mapped corner entrances corroborate portal phase. Orthographic placement aligns the separate shaft and wing, source ground datum is Y0, and geographic loading/unload passed. Individual entrance walk lengths and local planting are photographic reconstruction."
